          "id": "C",
          "text": "第一题等价于$(3z-1)(2z-1)\\ge0$，解集为$(-\\infty,\\frac13]\\cup[\\frac12,+\\infty)$；第二题等价于$P(2P-3)<0$，解集为$(0,\\frac32)$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "第一题等价于$(3z-1)(2z-1)\\ge0$，解集为$(-\\infty,\\frac13)\\cup(\\frac12,+\\infty)$；第二题等价于$P(2P-3)<0$，解集为$[0,\\frac32]$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "mode": "single",
      "stem": "设$D_1$为$y=\\sqrt{2x-x^2}$的实数定义域，$D_2$为$y=\\frac{24}{\\sqrt{x^2+4x+4}}$的实数定义域。哪一项给出了正确的$(D_1,D_2)$？",
      "figure_ids": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "$D_1=(0,2)$，$D_2=\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{-2\\}$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "$D_1=[0,2]$，$D_2=\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{-2\\}$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "$D_1=[0,2]$，$D_2=(-2,+\\infty)$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "$D_1=[0,2]$，$D_2=\\mathbb R$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "mode": "single",
      "stem": "设$f(x)=-x^2+8x+2$，$g(x)=2x^2+x-6$。求使$f(x)>9$成立的集合$S$和使$g(x)<4$成立的集合$T$。哪一项同时给出了正确的$(S,T)$？",
      "figure_ids": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "$S=(4-3\\sqrt2,4+3\\sqrt2)$，$T=(-2,\\frac32)$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "$S=(-\\infty,1)\\cup(7,+\\infty)$，$T=(-\\infty,-\\frac52)\\cup(2,+\\infty)$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "$S=[1,7]$，$T=[-\\frac52,2]$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "$S=(1,7)$，$T=(-\\frac52,2)$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "mode": "multiple",
      "stem": "利用图 12 判断下列解集陈述。记$f(x)=ax^2+bx+c$，$D=b^2-4ac$；在$a>0$且$D>0$时，记两个实根为$x_1<x_2$。选择所有正确的陈述。",
      "figure_ids": [
        "fig-12"
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "若$a>0$、$D>0$，则$f(x)>0$的解集为$(-\\infty,x_1)\\cup(x_2,+\\infty)$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "若$a>0$、$D>0$，则$f(x)>0$的解集为$(x_1,x_2)$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "若$a>0$、$D>0$，则$f(x)\\le0$的解集为$(x_1,x_2)$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "若$a>0$、$D>0$，则$f(x)\\le0$的解集为$[x_1,x_2]$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": "若$a<0$、$D<0$，则$f(x)\\ge0$的解集为$\\varnothing$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "F",
          "text": "若$a<0$、$D<0$，则$f(x)\\ge0$的解集为$\\mathbb R$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "G",
          "text": "若$a<0$、$D<0$，则$f(x)<0$的解集为$\\mathbb R$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "H",
          "text": "若$a<0$、$D<0$，则$f(x)<0$的解集为$\\varnothing$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "mode": "single",
      "stem": "约分$\\frac{x^2+x-56}{49-14x+x^2}$与$\\frac{(2y-3)^2-1}{y^2+7y-8}$，并保留原式的取值限制。哪一项同时给出两式正确的结果与限制？",
      "figure_ids": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "第一式为$\\frac{x+8}{x-7}$，$x\\ne7$；第二式为$\\frac{4(y-2)}{y+8}$，$y\\ne-8$且$y\\ne1$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "第一式为$x+8$，$x\\ne7$；第二式为$\\frac{4(y-2)}{y+8}$，$y\\ne-8$且$y\\ne1$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "第一式为$\\frac{x+8}{x-7}$，$x\\ne7$；第二式为$\\frac{2(y-2)}{y+8}$，$y\\ne-8$且$y\\ne1$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "第一式为$\\frac{x+8}{x-7}$，$x\\ne7$；第二式为$\\frac{4(y-2)}{y+8}$，只需$y\\ne-8$。",
          "figure_ids": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "mode": "multiple",
      "stem": "函数$y=x^2-7x-31$的图像经过下面哪些点？选择所有符合条件的点。",
      "figure_ids": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "$A(3,-43)$",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "$B(-8,89)$",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "$C(-5,-29)$",
          "figure_ids": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "mode": "single",
      "stem": "设$F(x)=-x^4+3x^3-6x+4$，$G(x)=x^5-x^3-6x+1$。分别判断$\\sqrt2$是否为$F$的根、$\\sqrt3$是否为$G$的根。哪一项给出了完整且正确的精确代入论证？",
      "figure_ids": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "$F(\\sqrt2)=-4+6\\sqrt2-6\\sqrt2+4=0$，所以$\\sqrt2$是根；$G(\\sqrt3)=9\\sqrt3-3\\sqrt3-6\\sqrt3=0$，所以$\\sqrt3$也是根。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "$F(\\sqrt2)=-2+6\\sqrt2-6\\sqrt2+4=2$，所以$\\sqrt2$不是根；$G(\\sqrt3)=9\\sqrt3-3\\sqrt3-6\\sqrt3+1=1$，所以$\\sqrt3$不是根。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "$F(\\sqrt2)=-4+6\\sqrt2-6\\sqrt2+4=0$，所以$\\sqrt2$是根；$G(\\sqrt3)=9\\sqrt3-3\\sqrt3-6\\sqrt3+1=1$，所以$\\sqrt3$不是根。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "$F(\\sqrt2)=-4+6\\sqrt2-6\\sqrt2+4=0$，所以$\\sqrt2$不是根；$G(\\sqrt3)=9\\sqrt3-3\\sqrt3-6\\sqrt3+1=1$，所以$\\sqrt3$是根。",
          "figure_ids": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
